        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8OUoMrll4u1CUuy3B6lXiqYLi_w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219817-turkish-red-lentil-soup-with-mint-DDMFS-step-01_35978-4103bac566564b9488b5dd9f63729264.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219817/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add onion and sauté until beginning to soften, about 2 minutes. Stir in garlic and cook for 2 minutes. Add diced tomatoes and cook for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mtULMCfLfphfpUxZnsgvQap3cjk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219817-turkish-red-lentil-soup-with-mint-DDMFS-step-02b_35984-99c714be58824600878037b1a7cfa267.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219817/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in chicken stock, lentils, bulgur, rice, tomato paste, mint, paprika, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until lentils and rice are tender, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
